  {"g3:08275405", "People have told me that you can get\\ndecorations in several ways.\\n\\nWe should have a race to see who can\\nget nicer decorations and furniture!\\n\\nIn the meantime, want to battle?", "People have told me that you can get\\ndecorations in several ways.\\n\\nWe should have a race to see who can\\nget nicer decorations and furniture!\\n\\nIn the meantime, want to battle?"},
  {"g3:082754b2", "This is my SECRET BASE.\\nI can't lose!", "This is my SECRET BASE.\\nI can't lose!"},
  {"g3:082754d8", "I'll battle with you anytime.", "I'll battle with you anytime."},
  {"g3:0827550c", "I won't lose at collecting decorations.\\nCome visit again!", "I won't lose at collecting decorations.\\nCome visit again!"},
  {"g3:08275546", "People have told me that you can get\\ndecorations in several ways.\\n\\nWe should have a race to see who can\\nget nicer decorations and furniture!", "People have told me that you can get\\ndecorations in several ways.\\n\\nWe should have a race to see who can\\nget nicer decorations and furniture!"},
  {"g3:082755d2", "I found a spot I liked, and I did it up\\nwith my favorite decorations.\\n\\nI raise my favorite POKéMON and grow\\nstronger with it.\\n\\nThat's what I do.\\nWant to battle with me?", "Encontrei um lugar que gosto,\\ncoloquei minhas decoraçöes favoritas.\\n\\nTreino meus favoritos POKéMON e fico\\nmais forte com ele.\\n\\nIsso é o que eu faço.\\nQuer lutar comigo?"},
  {"g3:08275679", "Show me what you're made of!", "Mostre-me o que pode fazer!"},
  {"g3:08275696", "I guess there are times when you're not\\ninto it.", "Eu acho que há momentos\\nque há muita indecisÃo."},
  {"g3:082756ef", "We can both become stronger.\\nLet's keep at it!", "Nós podemos ficar mais forte.\\nVamos continuar!"},
  {"g3:0827571e", "I found a spot I liked, and I did it up\\nwith my favorite decorations.\\n\\nI raise my favorite POKéMON and grow\\nstronger with it.\\n\\nEvery day is a great day.", "I found a spot I liked, and I did it up\\nwith my favorite decorations.\\n\\nI raise my favorite POKéMON and grow\\nstronger with it.\\n\\nEvery day is a great day."},
  {"g3:082757b5", "You can learn a lot about the taste\\nand sense of people by the kinds of\\n\\ndecorations they have, and how they\\n\\ndisplay them.\\n\\nWhat do you think of my taste?\\nAre you speechless?\\n\\nWant to see my taste in battling?", "You can learn a lot about the taste\\nand sense of people by the kinds of\\n\\ndecorations they have, and how they\\n\\ndisplay them.\\n\\nWhat do you think of my taste?\\nAre you speechless?\\n\\nWant to see my taste in battling?"},
  {"g3:08275884", "There's no holding back!", "There's no holding back!"},
  {"g3:0827589d", "I'll be happy to demonstrate my style\\nanytime.", "I'll be happy to demonstrate my style\\nanytime."},
  {"g3:08275909", "What did you think of my style?\\nI'll keep on polishing it!", "What did you think of my style?\\nI'll keep on polishing it!"},
  {"g3:08275944", "You can learn a lot about the taste\\nand sense of people by the kinds of\\n\\ndecorations they have, and how they\\n\\ndisplay them.\\n\\nWhat do you think of my taste?\\nAre you speechless?", "You can learn a lot about the taste\\nand sense of people by the kinds of\\n\\ndecorations they have, and how they\\n\\ndisplay them.\\n\\nWhat do you think of my taste?\\nAre you speechless?"},
  {"g3:082762c9", "What's that?\\nWhat am I doing?\\n\\nI'm thinking about making my own room\\nhere using a POKéMON move.\\n\\nI know! I'll give you this TM.\\nWill you use it to make your own room?", "O que é isso?\\nO que estou fazendo?\\n\\nEstou querendo fazer o meu próprio\\nquarto aqui.\\n\\nComo sou bonzinho! Vou te dar um (TM).\\nUse-o para fazer o seu próprio quarto?"},
  {"g3:0827636e", "Find a big tree that looks like it might\\ndrop some vines.\\n\\nUse SECRET POWER in front of the tree.\\nSome vines should get free and drop\\n\\ndown, so you can climb the tree.\\n\\nYou'll find a lot of space for putting\\nyour favorite things.\\n\\nIt'll be your own secret room...\\nA SECRET BASE!\\n\\nYou should make one, too.\\n\\nAnother thing, you don't always have\\nto make your SECRET BASE in a tree.\\n\\nTry using SECRET POWER on rock walls\\nthat have small indents in them.\\n\\nI'm going to look for other places, too.\\nOkay, bye!", "Encontre uma árvore grande com algumas\\nvinhas penduradas.\\n\\nUse DANO SECRETO na árvore.\\nAlgumas vinhas deve cair, assim você\\n\\npode escalar a árvore.\\n\\nVocê vai encontrar espaço para colocar\\nsuas coisas favoritas.\\n\\nEle vai ser o seu próprio quarto secreto...\\nUma BASE SECRETA!\\n\\nVocê deve fazer um também.\\n\\nOutra coisa, você nÃo tem que sempre\\nfazer a sua base secreta em uma árvore.\\n\\nTente usar DANO SECRETO em paredes\\nque têm pequenos buracos nelas.\\n\\nEu vou procurar outros lugares também.\\nOk, tchau!"},
  {"g3:0827655c", "Oh, you don't want this?\\nIf you change your mind, tell me, okay?", "Ah, você nÃo quer?\\nSe você mudar de idéia.\\n\\nDiga-me, está bem?"},
  {"g3:0827659d", "Oh, you don't have any room for this.\\n\\nI'll hold on to it, so come back for it\\nanother time, okay?", "Oh, you don't have any room for this.\\n\\nI'll hold on to it, so come back for it\\nanother time, okay?"},
  {"g3:082766aa", "All decorations and furniture in your\\nSECRET BASE will be returned to your PC.\\n\\nIs that okay?", "Todas as decoraçöes e móveis na sua\\nBASE SECRETA será enviado para seu PC.\\n\\nTudo bem?"},
  {"g3:08276707", "Do you want to register\\n{02}'s SECRET BASE?", "Você deseja registrar   \\n{02} BASE SECRETA?"},
  {"g3:08276731", "This data is already registered.\\nWould you like to delete it?", "Esta informaçÃo já está registrada.\\nGostaria de excluÍ-la?"},
  {"g3:0827676f", "Up to 10 locations can be registered.\\n\\nDelete a location if you want to\\nregister another location.", "Up to 10 locations can be registered.\\n\\nDelete a location if you want to\\nregister another location."},
  {"g3:082767d1", "Registration completed.", "Registro completo."},
  {"g3:082767e9", "Data has been unregistered.", "Os dados foram apagados."},
  {"g3:0827681a", "What would you like to do?", "O que você deseja fazer?"},
  {"g3:08276835", "Once registered, a SECRET BASE will not\\ndisappear unless the other TRAINER\\n\\nmoves it to a different location.\\n\\nIf a SECRET BASE is deleted from the\\nregistered list, another one may take\\n\\nits place.\\n\\nUp to ten SECRET BASE locations\\nmay be registered.", "Uma vez registrada, a BASE SECRETA\\nnÃo desaparece a menos que o outro\\n\\nTREINADOR mova para um local diferente.\\n\\nSe a BASE SECRETA é excluÍda da\\nlista registro, outro poderá ficar\\n\\nem seu lugar.\\n\\nAté 10 BASES SECRETAS\\npodem ser registradas."},
  {"g3:0827692b", "A shield of {03} that marks winning\\n{02} times in a row at the BATTLE TOWER.", "A shield of {03} that marks winning\\n{02} times in a row at the BATTLE TOWER."},
  {"g3:08276974", "A realistic toy TV. It could be easily\\nmistaken for the real thing.", "A realistic toy TV. It could be easily\\nmistaken for the real thing."},
  {"g3:082769b8", "A toy TV shaped like a SEEDOT.\\nIt looks ready to roll away on its own...", "A toy TV shaped like a SEEDOT.\\nIt looks ready to roll away on its own..."},
  {"g3:082769ff", "A toy TV shaped like a SKITTY.\\nIt looks ready to stroll away...", "A toy TV shaped like a SKITTY.\\nIt looks ready to stroll away..."},
  {"g3:08276a3d", "You may only make one SECRET BASE.\\n\\nWould you like to move from the SECRET\\nBASE near {02}?", "Você só pode fazer uma BASE SECRETA.\\n\\nGostaria de mudar sua BASE\\nSECRTETA perto da {02}?"},
  {"g3:08276a95", "Moving completed.\\n\\nWould you like to use the SECRET POWER?", "Movendo...\\n\\n... ... ...\\n\\nConcluÍdo.\\n\\nGostaria de usar DANO SECRETO?"},
  {"g3:08277ea4", "Welcome to the POKéMON CABLE\\nCLUB.\\n\\nWhich of our services do you wish\\nto use?", "Bem-vindo ao CLUBE POKéMON CABLE.\\n\\nQual de nossos serviços você\\ndeseja usar?"},
