  {"g3:0827863c", "{02} sent over one\\n{03}.", "{02} sent over one\\n{03}."},
  {"g3:08278651", "Sorry, there is a transmission error.\\n\\nYou may not mix records with  \\nJapanese Ruby or Sapphire games.\\n\\nAlso, you can't mix records with\\nJapanese Emerald and overseas Ruby\\n\\nor Sapphire games at the same time.", "Sorry, there is a transmission error.\\n\\nYou may not mix records with  \\nJapanese Ruby or Sapphire games.\\n\\nAlso, you can't mix records with\\nJapanese Emerald and overseas Ruby\\n\\nor Sapphire games at the same time."},
  {"g3:0827871f", "The Wireless Adapter is not\\nconnected properly.", "O adaptador sem fio nÃo está\\nconectado ainda."},
  {"g3:0827874f", "Participants are asked to step up\\nto the reception counter.", "Participants are asked to step up\\nto the reception counter."},
  {"g3:082788fc", "To use the BERRY CRUSH service,\\nyou must have at least one BERRY.", "To use the BERRY CRUSH service,\\nyou must have at least one BERRY."},
  {"g3:0827893e", "To enter the UNION ROOM, you must\\nhave at least two POKéMON.", "To enter the UNION ROOM, you must\\nhave at least two POKéMON."},
  {"g3:0827897b", "No POKéMON holding the {02}\\nBERRY may enter the UNION ROOM.", "No POKéMON holding the {02}\\nBERRY may enter the UNION ROOM."},
  {"g3:082789b5", "This is the POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB\\nUNION ROOM.\\n\\nUnfortunately, your Wireless\\nAdapter is not connected properly.\\n\\nPlease do come again.", "Este é o CLUBE POKéMON WIRELESS\\nUNION ROOM.\\n\\nInfelizmente, o seu Adaptador sem fio\\nnÃo está ligado corretamente.\\n\\nPor favor, volte."},
  {"g3:08278a48", "It appears as if {02} is playing\\nright now.\\n\\nGo for it!", "It appears as if {02} is playing\\nright now.\\n\\nGo for it!"},
  {"g3:08278a7d", "I can explain game rules to you,\\nif you'd like.\\n\\nWhich game should I describe?", "Se quiser, te explico as regras.\\n\\nVamos lá entÃo...\\nDe que jogo devo descrever?"},
  {"g3:08278acb", "«POKéMON JUMP»\\n\\nMake your POKéMON skip the VINE WHIP\\nrope with the A Button.\\n\\nOnly mini POKéMON around 28 inches\\nor less may participate.\\n\\nPOKéMON that only swim, burrow,\\nor fly are not good at jumping.\\n\\nAs a result, those POKéMON may not\\nparticipate.\\n\\nGood things happen if everyone\\njumps in time.", "«PULA POKéMON»\\n\\nFaça seu POKéMON pular uma corda\\nde vinha com o BotÃo A.\\n\\nApenas MINI POKéMON cerca de 28\\ncentÍmetros ou menos pode participar.\\n\\nOs POKéMON que só nadam, cava,\\nou voa nÃo é bom em pular.\\n\\nEntÃo, esses POKéMON nÃo devem\\nparticipar.\\n\\nBoas coisas acontecem, se todos\\npulam no tempo."},
  {"g3:08278bf1", "«DODRIO BERRY-PICKING»\\n\\nCommand DODRIO's three heads to\\ncatch falling BERRIES.\\n\\nPress right, up, or left on the\\n|<|Ç Control Pad to move the heads.\\n\\nTo play this game, you must have\\na DODRIO.", "«DODRIO CAPTURA-FRUTO»\\n\\nComande DODRIO de 3 cabeças para\\npegar FRUTOS.\\n\\nAperte para →, para ↑ ou para ← no\\n|<|Ç Controle para mover as cabeças.\\n\\nPara jogar este jogo você\\ndeve ter um DODRIO."},
  {"g3:08278cac", "If you want to play a game,\\nplease tell the old man beside me.", "Se você quiser jogar um jogo,\\ninforme ao velho do meu lado."},
  {"g3:08278ceb", "Hi, welcome!\\nAre you here to play games using\\n\\nWireless Communication?\\n\\nCan you wait just a little bit?", "Oi, bem-vindo!\\nVocê está aqui para jogar a jogos\\n\\ncom ComunicaçÃo sem fio?\\n\\nPode esperar um segundo?"},
  {"g3:08278d51", "All right, come again!", "All right, come again!"},
  {"g3:08278d68", "The Wireless Adapter isn't connected.\\nCome back when it's hooked up!", "O adaptador sem fio nÃo está conectado.\\nVolte quando estiver ligado!"},
  {"g3:08278dad", "All right, which game did you want\\nto play?", "All right, which game did you want\\nto play?"},
  {"g3:08278dd9", "Which POKéMON would you like to\\nenter?", "Qual POKéMON gostaria de\\nparticipar?"},
  {"g3:08278e60", "It doesn't look like you have any\\nPOKéMON that you can enter...\\n\\nWould you like me to explain what\\nkinds of POKéMON can enter?", "It doesn't look like you have any\\nPOKéMON that you can enter...\\n\\nWould you like me to explain what\\nkinds of POKéMON can enter?"},
  {"g3:08278edc", "«POKéMON JUMP» is open to POKéMON\\naround 28 inches or less.\\n\\nWhat you can't enter are those\\nPOKéMON that can't jump.\\n\\nYou know, like POKéMON that only\\nswim, burrow, or fly.\\n\\nThat's all you need to know.", "«POKéMON JUMP» is open to POKéMON\\naround 28 inches or less.\\n\\nWhat you can't enter are those\\nPOKéMON that can't jump.\\n\\nYou know, like POKéMON that only\\nswim, burrow, or fly.\\n\\nThat's all you need to know."},
  {"g3:08278fa4", "DODRIO BERRY-PICKING is a game that \\nonly DODRIO may enter.", "DODRIO CAPTURA-FRUTO é um jogo que\\nsó DODRIO pode entrar."},
  {"g3:08279013", "Welcome to the POKéMON WIRELESS\\nCLUB DIRECT CORNER.\\n\\nYou may interact directly with\\nyour friends here.\\n\\nWhich room would you like to\\nenter?", "Welcome to the POKéMON WIRELESS\\nCLUB DIRECT CORNER.\\n\\nYou may interact directly with\\nyour friends here.\\n\\nWhich room would you like to\\nenter?"},
  {"g3:0827909d", "Would you like to trade POKéMON?", "Would you like to trade POKéMON?"},
  {"g3:082790be", "Which Battle Mode would you like\\nto play?", "Qual Modo de Batalha você deseja\\njogar?"},
  {"g3:082790e8", "Would you like to access\\nthe RECORD CORNER?", "Would you like to access\\nthe RECORD CORNER?"},
  {"g3:08279114", "Would you like to use the\\nBERRY CRUSH System?", "Would you like to use the\\nBERRY CRUSH System?"},
  {"g3:08279142", "There are three Battle Modes.\\n\\nSINGLE BATTLE is for two TRAINERS\\nwith one or more POKéMON each.\\n\\nEach TRAINER can have one POKéMON\\nin battle at a time.\\n\\nDOUBLE BATTLE is for two TRAINERS\\nwith two or more POKéMON each.\\n\\nEach TRAINER will send out two\\nPOKéMON in battle at a time.\\n\\nMULTI BATTLE is for four TRAINERS\\nwith one or more POKéMON each.\\n\\nEach TRAINER can have one POKéMON\\nin battle at a time.", "There are three Battle Modes.\\n\\nSINGLE BATTLE is for two TRAINERS\\nwith one or more POKéMON each.\\n\\nEach TRAINER can have one POKéMON\\nin battle at a time.\\n\\nDOUBLE BATTLE is for two TRAINERS\\nwith two or more POKéMON each.\\n\\nEach TRAINER will send out two\\nPOKéMON in battle at a time.\\n\\nMULTI BATTLE is for four TRAINERS\\nwith one or more POKéMON each.\\n\\nEach TRAINER can have one POKéMON\\nin battle at a time."},
  {"g3:082792cd", "Please decide which of you two\\nwill become the LEADER.\\n\\nThe other player must then choose\\n«JOIN GROUP.»", "Please decide which of you two\\nwill become the LEADER.\\n\\nThe other player must then choose\\n«JOIN GROUP.»"},
  {"g3:08279334", "Please decide which of you four\\nwill become the GROUP LEADER.\\n\\nThe other players must then choose\\n«JOIN GROUP.»", "Please decide which of you four\\nwill become the GROUP LEADER.\\n\\nThe other players must then choose\\n«JOIN GROUP.»"},
  {"g3:082793a3", "Please decide which of you will\\nbecome the GROUP LEADER.\\n\\nThe other players must then choose\\n«JOIN GROUP.»", "Please decide which of you will\\nbecome the GROUP LEADER.\\n\\nThe other players must then choose\\n«JOIN GROUP.»"},
  {"g3:0827940d", "Welcome to the POKéMON WIRELESS\\nCLUB UNION ROOM.\\n\\nYou may interact directly with\\nother TRAINERS here, some of\\n\\nwhom you may not even know.\\n\\nWould you like to enter the ROOM?", "Welcome to the POKéMON WIRELESS\\nCLUB UNION ROOM.\\n\\nYou may interact directly with\\nother TRAINERS here, some of\\n\\nwhom you may not even know.\\n\\nWould you like to enter the ROOM?"},
  {"g3:082794b8", "The TRAINERS in the UNION ROOM\\nwill be those players around you\\n\\nwho have also entered the ROOM.\\n\\nYou may do all sorts of things\\nhere, such as exchanging greetings.\\n\\nYou may enter two POKéMON up to\\nLv. 30 for a one-on-one battle.\\n\\nYou may take part in a chat with\\ntwo to five people.\\n\\nOr, you may register a POKéMON for\\ntrade.\\n\\nWould you like to enter the ROOM?", "The TRAINERS in the UNION ROOM\\nwill be those players around you\\n\\nwho have also entered the ROOM.\\n\\nYou may do all sorts of things\\nhere, such as exchanging greetings.\\n\\nYou may enter two POKéMON up to\\nLv. 30 for a one-on-one battle.\\n\\nYou may take part in a chat with\\ntwo to five people.\\n\\nOr, you may register a POKéMON for\\ntrade.\\n\\nWould you like to enter the ROOM?"},
  {"g3:0827961c", "I hope you enjoy your time in\\nthe UNION ROOM.", "I hope you enjoy your time in\\nthe UNION ROOM."},
  {"g3:0827964a", "Hello!\\nMy name is TEALA.\\n\\nThis must be your first time\\nup here.\\n\\nI'll show you how the Wireless\\nCommunication System works.\\n\\nFirst, I need to show you this\\nfloor of our POKéMON CENTER.\\n\\nRight this way, please.", "Olá!\\nMeu nome é TEALA.\\n\\nEsta deve ser a sua primeira vez\\naqui em cima.\\n\\nEu vou mostrar como o SISTEMA WIRELESS\\nfunciona.\\n\\nPrimeiro, eu preciso mostrar este andar\\ndo nosso CENTRO POKéMON.\\n\\nPor aqui, por favor."},
  {"g3:08279718", "On the top floor, there are two\\nrooms.\\n\\nFirst, the room on the left.\\nIt's the UNION ROOM.\\n\\nYou may link up with TRAINERS\\naround you who have also entered\\n\\nthe UNION ROOM.\\n\\nWith them, you may do things like\\nchat, battle, and trade.\\n\\nSecond, the room on the right is\\nthe DIRECT CORNER.\\n\\nYou may trade or battle POKéMON\\nwith your friends in this room.\\n\\nIf the Wireless Adapter isn't\\nconnected, you may still link up\\n\\nusing a GBA Game Link cable.\\n\\nIf that is the case, you must go\\nto the DIRECT CORNER.\\n\\nI hope you enjoy the Wireless \\nCommunication System.", "Nesse andar, há 2 quartos.\\n\\nPrimeiro: O quarto à esquerda.\\nÉ o UNION ROOM.\\n\\nVocê pode conectar com treinadores\\nperto de você que também entraram\\n\\nno UNION ROOM.\\n\\nCom eles, você pode fazer coisas como\\nbate-papo, batalha e comércio.\\n\\nSegundo: O quarto da direita é   \\nO DIRECT CORNER.\\n\\nVocê pode negociar ou batalhar com\\nseus amigos nesta sala.\\n\\nSe o adaptador sem fio nÃo está\\nconectado, você pode ainda linkar\\n\\nusando um cabo link do GBA.\\n\\nSe for esse o caso, você deve ir para\\nO DIRECT CORNER.\\n\\nEspero que goste do SISTEMA WIRELESS\\nde ComunicaçÃo."},
  {"g3:08279937", "Hello, {01}!\\n\\nIt's me, TEALA, the POKéMON\\nCENTER 2F attendant.\\n\\nIs there something you needed to\\nask me about linking?", "Olá, {01}!\\n\\nSou eu, TEALA, atendente do 2F\\ndo CENTRO POKéMON.\\n\\nHá algo que você precise me perguntar\\nsobre vinculaçÃo?"},
  {"g3:082799aa", "Let me explain how the POKéMON\\nWIRELESS CLUB works.\\n\\nOn this, the top floor, there are\\ntwo rooms.\\n\\nFirst, the room on the left.\\nIt's the UNION ROOM.\\n\\nYou may link up with TRAINERS\\naround you who have also entered\\n\\nthe UNION ROOM.\\n\\nWith them, you may do things like\\nchat, battle, and trade.\\n\\nSecond, the room on the right is\\nthe DIRECT CORNER.\\n\\nYou may trade or battle POKéMON\\nwith your friends in this room.\\n\\nSometimes, you may not be able to\\nfind your friends in the UNION ROOM\\n\\nor the DIRECT CORNER.\\n\\nIn that case, please move closer\\nto your friends.\\n\\nIf the Wireless Adapter isn't\\nconnected, you may still link up\\n\\nusing a GBA Game Link cable.\\n\\nIf that is the case, you must go\\nto the DIRECT CORNER.\\n\\nI hope you enjoy the Wireless \\nCommunication System.", "Deixe-me explicar como o CLUBE        \\nPOKéMON sem fio funciona.\\n\\nAqui neste andar, há 2 quartos.\\n\\nPrimeiro: O quarto à nossa esquerda.           \\nÉ o UNION ROOM.\\n\\nVocê pode vincular-se com treinadores\\nem torno de você que também entrou\\n\\nno UNION ROOM.\\n\\nCom eles, você pode fazer coisas como\\nbate-papo, batalha e comércio.\\n\\nSegundo: O quarto da direita é                \\nO DIRECT CORNER.\\n\\nVocê pode negociar ou batalhar com\\nseus amigos naquela sala.\\n\\nSe o adaptador sem fio nÃo está\\nconectado, você pode ainda linkar\\n\\nusando um cabo link do GBA.\\n\\nSe for esse o caso, você deve ir para\\nO DIRECT CORNER o terceiro quarto.\\n\\nBem, é isso, quelquer dúvida\\nvenha falar comigo outra vez.\\n\\nAgora, espero que voçê goste do nosso\\nSISTEMA WIRELESS de ComunicaçÃo."},
  {"g3:08279c91", "I hope you enjoy the Wireless\\nCommunication System.", "Aprecie o nosso Sistema Wireless\\nde ComunicaçÃo."},
  {"g3:0827ada7", "Hello!\\n\\nThis is the reception counter for\\nPOKéMON CONTESTS.\\n\\nOh? It appears that you don't have\\na POKéBLOCK CASE yet.\\n\\nIn that case, we need to provide you\\nwith this!", "Olá!\\n\\nEste é o balcÃo de recepçÃo do\\nCONCURSO POKéMON.\\n\\nOh? Parece que você nÃo tem\\num PORTA POKéBLOCK ainda.\\n\\nNesse caso, é preciso fornecer\\na você um como esse!"},
  {"g3:0827ae47", "Okay, now that we've cleared that\\nup...\\n\\nHello!\\n\\nThis is the reception counter for\\nPOKéMON CONTESTS.", "Ok, agora que já esclarecemos\\nisso aqui...\\n\\nOlá!\\n\\nEste é o balcÃo de recepçÃo do\\nCONCURSO POKéMON."},
  {"g3:0827aea8", "Hello!\\n\\nThis is the reception counter for\\nPOKéMON CONTESTS.", "Olá!\\n\\nEste é o balcÃo de recepçÃo do\\nCONCURSO POKéMON."},
  {"g3:0827af28", "Would you like to enter your POKéMON\\nin our CONTESTS?", "Gostaria de entrar o seu POKéMON\\nem nossos CONCURSOS?"},
  {"g3:0827af5e", "Which topic would you like?", "Que tema você gostaria?"},
  {"g3:0827af7a", "A POKéMON CONTEST involves four\\nTRAINERS entering one POKéMON each\\n\\nin competitive judging.\\n\\nA CONTEST has two stages of judging,\\nprimary and secondary.\\n\\nPrimary judging is a popularity poll\\ninvolving the audience.\\n\\nSecondary judging features appeals\\nby the POKéMON using their moves.\\n\\nPlan appeals carefully to earn the\\nmost attention of the JUDGE and\\n\\nexcite the audience.\\n\\nDo your best to stand out.\\n\\nThe primary and secondary scores are\\nadded at the end.\\n\\nThe POKéMON garnering the highest\\nscore is declared the winner.", "Um CONCURSO POKéMON envolve 4\\nTREINADORES com 1 POKéMON cada\\n\\nno julgamento aqui.\\n\\nA competiçÃo tem duas fases para julgar,\\nprimária e secundária.\\n\\nA primária julga a popularidade\\nenvolvendo o público.\\n\\nA secundária julga caracterÍsticas\\ne recursos do POKéMON usando\\n\\nseus golpes.\\n\\nPlaneje cuidadosamente como ganhar mais\\natençÃo do juiz e excitar a platéia.\\n\\nFaça o seu melhor para se destacar.\\n\\nAs pontuaçöes primárias e secundárias\\nsÃo adicionadas no final.\\n\\nO POKéMON que tiver maior pontuaçÃo é\\ndeclarado o VENCEDOR."},
  {"g3:0827b17d", "There are five kinds of CONTESTS.\\n\\nCOOL, BEAUTY, CUTE, SMART, and\\nTOUGH are the five categories.\\n\\nChoose the CONTEST that is right for\\nthe POKéMON you plan to enter.", "Existem 5 tipos de CONCURSOS.\\n\\nCARISMA, BELEZA, GRAÇA, ESPERTO e\\nDUREZA sÃo as 5 categorias aqui.\\n\\nEscolha o CONCURSO que é certo para\\no POKéMON que vai participar."},
  {"g3:0827b221", "There are four ranks of POKéMON\\nCONTESTS.\\n\\nNORMAL, SUPER, HYPER, and MASTER\\nare the four ranks.\\n\\nIn the NORMAL Rank, any POKéMON may\\nenter.\\n\\nAny POKéMON that won a NORMAL Rank\\nCONTEST may move up to the SUPER Rank\\n\\nin the same category.\\n\\nIn the same way, a SUPER Rank winner\\ncan move up to the HYPER Rank, and\\n\\na HYPER Rank winner can advance to\\n\\nthe MASTER Rank in the same category.\\n\\nA POKéMON that won in the MASTER Rank\\nmay compete in the MASTER Rank as\\n\\noften as its TRAINER wants.", "Há 4 nÍveis do CONCURSO POKéMON.\\n\\nNORMAL, ALTO, AVANÇADO e MESTRE\\nsÃo os 4 nÍveis.\\n\\nNo NV. NORMAL, qualquer POKéMON\\npode entrar.\\n\\nQualquer POKéMON que ganhou no NV.\\nNORMAL pode seguir para o NV. ALTO\\n\\nna mesma categoria.\\n\\nDa mesma forma, um vencedor do NV. ALTO\\npode seguir para o NV. AVANÇADO, e um\\n\\nvencedor do NV. AVANÇADO pode avançar\\n\\npara o NV. MESTRE na mesma categoria.\\n\\nUm POKéMON que venceu no NV. MESTRE\\npode competir no NV. MESTRE quantas\\n\\nvezes o seu TREINADOR queira."},
  {"g3:0827b3ff", "Which Rank would you like to enter?", "Qual nÍvel você gostaria de entrar?"},
  {"g3:0827b423", "Which CONTEST would you like to enter?", "Qual CONCURSO gostaria de participar?"},
  {"g3:0827b44a", "Which POKéMON would you like to enter?", "Qual POKéMON gostaria de participar?"},
  {"g3:0827b471", "I'm terribly sorry, but your POKéMON\\nis not qualified to compete at this\\n\\nRank yet...", "Eu sinto muito, mas seu POKéMON\\nnÃo está qualificado para competir\\n\\nneste nÍvel..."},
  {"g3:0827b4c4", "I'm sorry, but an EGG cannot take part\\nin a POKéMON CONTEST.", "I'm sorry, but an EGG cannot take part\\nin a POKéMON CONTEST."},
  {"g3:0827b501", "Your POKéMON appears to be in no\\ncondition to take part in a CONTEST...", "Your POKéMON appears to be in no\\ncondition to take part in a CONTEST..."},
  {"g3:0827b547", "Oh, but that RIBBON...\\n\\nYour POKéMON has won this CONTEST\\nbefore, hasn't it?\\n\\nWould you like to enter it in this\\nCONTEST anyway?", "Oh, mas essa FITA...\\n\\nSeu POKéMON já ganhou\\neste CONCURSO, nÃo é?\\n\\nEntÃo, gostaria de increve-lo\\nneste CONCURSO novamente?"},
  {"g3:0827b5c4", "Is that your CONTEST POKéMON?", "Is that your CONTEST POKéMON?"},
  {"g3:0827b5e2", "Okay, your POKéMON will be entered\\nin this CONTEST.\\n\\nYour POKéMON is Entry No. 4.\\nThe CONTEST will begin shortly.", "Ok, o seu POKéMON será inscrito\\nneste CONCURSO.\\n\\nSeu POKéMON será o de Número 4.\\nO CONCURSO terá inÍcio em breve."},
  {"g3:0827b653", "Please come in through here.\\nGood luck!", "Por favor, venha por aqui.\\nBoa sorte!"},
  {"g3:0827b67b", "Congratulations! Your POKéMON is the\\nCONTEST winner!\\n\\nWe have your prize right here.\\nPlease, right this way!", "Congratulations! Your POKéMON is the\\nCONTEST winner!\\n\\nWe have your prize right here.\\nPlease, right this way!"},
  {"g3:0827b6e7", "Please come back for your prize\\nlater on.", "Please come back for your prize\\nlater on."},
  {"g3:0827b711", "MC: Hello! We're just getting started\\nwith a {04} Rank POKéMON\\n\\n{03}!\\n\\nThe participating TRAINERS and their\\nPOKéMON are as follows:", "MC: Olá! Vamos começar um  \\nCONCURSO POKéMON de {03}\\n\\ndo nÍvel {04}!\\n\\nOs TREINADORES participantes e seus\\nPOKéMON sÃo os seguintes:"},
  {"g3:0827b815", "MC: Entry No. {03}!\\n{02}'s {04}!", "MC: Número {03}!\\n{04} de {02}!"},
  {"g3:0827b830", "MC: We've just seen the four POKéMON\\ncontestants.\\n\\nNow it's time for primary judging!\\n\\nThe audience will vote on their\\nfavorite POKéMON contestants.\\n\\nWithout any further ado, let the\\nvoting begin!", "MC: Nós acabamos de ver os 4 POKéMON\\ncompetidores.\\n\\nAgora é hora do primeiro julgamento!\\n\\nO platéia vai votar no seu concorrente\\na POKéMON favorito.\\n\\nOk, sem mais delongas\\nvamos começar a votaçÃo!"},
  {"g3:0827b8f2", "Voting under way...", "VotaçÃo em curso..."},
  {"g3:0827b904", "Voting is now complete!\\n\\nWhile the votes are being tallied,\\nlet's move on to secondary judging!\\n\\nThe second stage of judging is the\\nmuch anticipated appeal time!\\n\\nMay the contestants amaze us with\\nsuperb appeals of dazzling moves!\\n\\nLet's see a little enthusiasm!\\nLet's appeal!", "VotaçÃo terminada!\\n\\nEnquanto contam os votos, vamos\\npara o segundo julgamento.\\n\\nA segunda etapa a julgar é muito\\naguardada o momento apelo!\\n\\nQue os concorrentes nos surpreenda com\\napelos e movimentos deslumbrantes.\\n\\nVamos ver um pouco de entusiasmo.\\nBem... Vamos entÃo apelar!"},
  {"g3:0827ba15", "MC: That's it for judging!", "MC: O julgamento terminou!"},
  {"g3:0827ba30", "Thank you all for a most wonderful\\ndisplay of quality appeals!\\n\\nThis concludes all judging!\\nThank you for your fine efforts!", "Obrigada a todos pela maravilhosa\\nexibiçÃo de apelos e qualidade.\\n\\nIsso conclui todo julgamento.\\nObrigada por seus esforços!"},
  {"g3:0827baac", "Now, all that remains is the pulse-\\npounding proclamation of the winner.\\n\\nThe JUDGE looks ready to make\\nthe announcement!", "Agora, tudo o que resta é o pulso\\nbatendo proclamando o vencedor.\\n\\nO JUIZ parece pronto para fazer\\no seu anúncio agora."},
  {"g3:0827bb25", "JUDGE: We will now declare the winner!", "JUIZ: Vamos agora declarar o vencedor!"},
  {"g3:0827bb4c", "MC: Entry No. {03}!\\n\\n{04} and {02},\\ncongratulations!", "MC: Número {03}!\\n\\n{04} e {02},\\nUau... Meus parabéns!"},
  {"g3:0827bb7a", "MC: Congratulations!\\nPlease do compete again!", "MC: Parabéns!\\nFavor venha competir novamente."},
  {"g3:0827bba8", "MC: Here you are!\\nPlease accept your prize!", "MC: Aqui está!\\nPorfavor, aceite seu prêmio!"},
  {"g3:0827bbd4", "We confer on you this RIBBON\\nas your prize!", "Vamos lhe oferecer esta «FITA»\\ncomo prêmio!"},
  {"g3:0827bc00", "{01} received a RIBBON.", "{01} ganhou uma «FITA»."},
  {"g3:0827bc16", "{01} put the RIBBON on\\n{02}.", "{01} coloca a FITA em\\n{02}."},
  {"g3:0827bc2f", "Please pick up your prize at\\nthe reception counter later.\\n\\nPlease do compete again!", "Please pick up your prize at\\nthe reception counter later.\\n\\nPlease do compete again!"},
  {"g3:0827bd17", "Before entering a CONTEST, your\\nprogress will be saved.", "Antes de entrar num CONCURSO, seu\\nprogresso será salvo."},
  {"g3:0827bd4f", "We hope you will participate another\\ntime.", "Esperamos que você\\nparticipe outra hora."},
  {"g3:0827befa", "Transmission error...", "Transmission error..."},
  {"g3:0827bf0e", "You may have chosen a different\\nCONTEST than another player.", "You may have chosen a different\\nCONTEST than another player."},
  {"g3:0827bf4b", "You may have made a different\\nchoice than another player.", "You may have made a different\\nchoice than another player."},
  {"g3:0827bf85", "Please wait.\\n... ... B Button: Cancel", "Please wait.\\n... ... B Button: Cancel"},
  {"g3:0827c063", "Welcome! This is the POKéMON CONTEST\\nlink reception counter.\\n\\nYou may enter CONTESTS together with\\none or more friends.", "Bem-vindo! Este é o balcÃo LINK do\\nCONCURSO POKéMON.\\n\\nVocê pode participar de CONCURSOS,\\njunto com um ou mais amigos."},
  {"g3:0827c0da", "Which topic would you like?", "Que tema você gostaria?"},
  {"g3:0827c0f6", "Would you like to enter a CONTEST?", "Deseja participar de um CONCURSO?"},
  {"g3:0827c119", "Which CONTEST would you like to enter?", "Qual CONCURSO gostaria de participar?"},
  {"g3:0827c140", "Your POKéMON appears to be in no\\ncondition to take part in a CONTEST...", "Your POKéMON appears to be in no\\ncondition to take part in a CONTEST..."},
  {"g3:0827c186", "I'm sorry, but an EGG cannot take part\\nin a POKéMON CONTEST.", "I'm sorry, but an EGG cannot take part\\nin a POKéMON CONTEST."},
  {"g3:0827c1c3", "Which POKéMON would you like to enter?", "Qual POKéMON gostaria de participar?"},
  {"g3:0827c1ea", "Please decide which of you will\\nbecome the GROUP LEADER.\\n\\nThe other players must then choose\\n«JOIN GROUP.»", "Please decide which of you will\\nbecome the GROUP LEADER.\\n\\nThe other players must then choose\\n«JOIN GROUP.»"},
  {"g3:0827c254", "At least one player has entered using\\nthe 4-player reception counter.\\n\\nThere must be four players connected\\nusing a GBA Game Link cable.\\n\\nWhen the four players are ready,\\nselect G-MODE (GLOBAL MODE),\\n\\nthen register to enter again, please.", "At least one player has entered using\\nthe 4-player reception counter.\\n\\nThere must be four players connected\\nusing a GBA Game Link cable.\\n\\nWhen the four players are ready,\\nselect G-MODE (GLOBAL MODE),\\n\\nthen register to enter again, please."},
  {"g3:0827c340", "This is a CONTEST for two to four\\nplayers linked using a Wireless\\n\\nAdapter or a GBA Game Link cable.\\n\\nParticipants are first asked to choose\\nthe mode they wish to enter.\\n\\nThere are two different modes.\\n\\nE-MODE (EMERALD MODE) is for\\ntwo to four players, each with a\\n\\nPOKéMON Emerald Game Pak.\\n\\nG-MODE (GLOBAL MODE) is only for\\nfour players, each with a POKéMON\\n\\nEmerald, Ruby, or Sapphire Game Pak.\\n\\nThe players should discuss which mode\\nthey want, then choose the same mode.\\n\\nOnce all the players have chosen\\nthe same CONTEST in the same mode,\\n\\nthe entry registration is complete.\\n\\nAfter that, a CONTEST will start in\\nthe usual manner.", "Este é um CONCURSO para 2-4 jogadores\\nligado usando um Wireless Adapter ou um\\n\\ncabo link do GBA.\\n\\nOs participantes sÃo convidados a\\nescolher 1º o modo que deseja entrar.\\n\\nExistem 2 modos diferentes.\\n\\nE-MODE (MODO ESMERALDA) é para\\n2-4  jogadores, cada um com um\\n\\nPOKéMON Esmeralda Game.\\n\\nG-MODE (MODO GLOBAL) é apenas para\\n4 jogadores, cada um com um POKéMON\\n\\nEsmeralda, Rubi, ou Safira Game.\\n\\nOs jogadores deve discutir qual o modo\\nentrar e escolher o mesmo modo.\\n\\nUma vez que todos os jogadores tenham\\nescolhido o mesmo concurso no mesmo\\n\\nmodo o registo de entrada é completo.\\n\\nDepois disso, o CONCURSO terá inÍcio da\\nmaneira usual."},
  {"g3:0827c5b1", "In E-MODE (EMERALD MODE),\\na LINK CONTEST can be held with\\n\\ntwo to four players. Each player must\\n\\nhave a POKéMON Emerald Game Pak.\\n\\nThe players must be linked with each\\nother using Wireless Adapters or\\n\\nGBA Game Link cables.\\n\\nIf there are fewer than four players,\\nTRAINERS in the hall will join to fill\\n\\nthe 4-player CONTEST lineup.\\n\\nPlease be aware that E-MODE is not\\navailable in POKéMON Ruby or Sapphire.", "Em E-MODE (EMERALD MODE),\\num CONCURSO link pode ser realizado\\n\\ncom 2-4 jogadores. Cada jogador deve\\n\\nter um POKéMON Esmeralda Game.\\n\\nOs jogadores devem estar ligados com os\\noutros utilizando Wireless Adapters ou\\n\\nGBA cabo link.\\n\\nSe houver menos de 4 jogadores,\\nTREINADORES na sala irá juntar-se\\n\\naté obter os 4 jogadores.\\n\\nAtençÃo!\\n\\nFique ciente de que  E-MODE nÃo é\\ndisponÍvel no POKéMON Rubi ou Safira."},
  {"g3:0827c742", "G-MODE (GLOBAL MODE) is specifically\\nfor four players who are linked using\\n\\nGBA Game Link cables.\\n\\nEach player must have a POKéMON\\nEmerald, Ruby, or Sapphire Game Pak.\\n\\nThe CONTEST starts after all players\\nchoose G-MODE (POKéMON Emerald) or\\n\\nenter through the 4-player reception\\n\\ncounter (POKéMON Ruby or Sapphire).", "G-MODE (GLOBAL MODE),\\né especificamente para 4 jogadores que\\n\\nestÃo ligadas com GBA cabo link.\\n\\nCada jogador deve ter um POKéMON\\nEsmeralda, Rubi ou Safira.\\n\\nO CONCURSO começa após todos os\\njogadores escolher G-MODE.\\n\\n(POKéMON Emerald) ou entrar através\\n\\nda recepçÃo de 4 jogadores contando\\n\\n(POKéMON Rubi ou Safira)."},
  {"g3:0827c879", "I'm terribly sorry.\\n\\nG-MODE does not function\\nwith Wireless Adapters.\\n\\nPlease select E-MODE or try\\nagain using a GBA Game Link cable.", "I'm terribly sorry.\\n\\nG-MODE does not function\\nwith Wireless Adapters.\\n\\nPlease select E-MODE or try\\nagain using a GBA Game Link cable."},
  {"g3:0827c8fd", "Which CONTEST MODE would you like\\nto enter?", "Qual CATEGORIA você gostaria\\nde participar?"},
  {"g3:0827ef15", "Oh, hello! You were in a POKéMON\\nCONTEST, weren't you?\\n\\nIt's easy to tell from your POKéMON.\\n\\nI'm a reporter. I'm working on a story\\non POKéMON CONTESTS.\\n\\nIf I may, would you be willing to answer\\na few questions?", "Oh, Olá! Você estava no CONCURSO\\nPOKéMON, nÃo foi?\\n\\nÉ fácil saber vendo seu POKéMON.\\n\\nEu sou um repórter. Eu escrevo sobre as\\nhistórias de CONCURSOS POKéMON.\\n\\nSe me permite, você pode responder\\nalgumas perguntas?"},
  {"g3:0827efe7", "Oh, you will?\\nThank you.\\n\\nBriefly, how would you describe the\\nCONTEST you just entered?", "Ah, você vai?\\nObrigado.\\n\\nResumidamente, como você descreve o\\nCONCURSO que participou?"},
  {"g3:0827f03e", "Ah, I see.\\nThat's a very edifying comment.\\n\\nYou get a good feel for what\\nthe CONTEST was like.\\n\\nI've got one last question.\\n\\nWhen you hear the word «{03},»\\nwhat image do you get?", "Ah, sim.\\nFoi um comentário muito edificante.\\n\\nVocê fez uma boa noçÃo do que\\nfoi o CONCURSO.\\n\\nEu tenho uma última pergunta.\\n\\nQuando você ouve a palavra «{03},»\\nvocê imagina o que?"},
  {"g3:0827f0ec", "I see!\\n\\nSo that's how you imagine the concept\\nof «{03}» to be.\\n\\nThank you!\\nYou've given me some good ideas.\\n\\nI think I can write a good story on\\nPOKéMON CONTESTS now.\\n\\nMaybe, just maybe, this story will even\\nmake it to television.\\n\\nI hope you'll look forward to it!", "Oh... eu vejo!\\n\\nEntÃo é assim que você imagina ser o\\nconceito de «{03}».\\n\\nObrigado!\\nVocê me deu algumas boas idéias.\\n\\nEu acho que posso escrever uma boa\\nhistória agora.\\n\\nTalvez, esta história seja até exibida\\nna televisÃo. Eu espero que você\\n\\nnÃo deixe de assistir."},
  {"g3:0827f1ef", "Oh, too bad...\\n\\nWell, if you come across a good story,\\nplease do share it with me.", "Oh, muito ruim...\\n\\nBem, se você conhecer uma boa história,\\ncompartilhe comigo."},
  {"g3:0827f23f", "I'll be looking forward to your next\\nPOKéMON CONTEST.", "Vou ficar ansioso pelo seu próximo\\nCONCURSO POKéMON."},
  {"g3:0827f704", "Hello! You're the TRAINER who just had\\na battle, right?\\n\\nI'm gathering interviews with TRAINERS\\nall over the place.\\n\\nMay I get a few words from you about\\nyour impressions on battling?", "Olá! Você é um TREINADOR que já\\nbatalhou aqui, certo?\\n\\nEstou reunindo entrevistas com\\nTREINADORES em todo lugar.\\n\\nPosso obter algumas palavras sobre\\nsuas impressöes sobre o combate?"},
  {"g3:0827f7ba", "You will? Really?\\nThank you!\\n\\nThen, uh...\\n\\nHow did things turn out in\\nthe BATTLE TOWER today?\\n\\nWere you satisfied with the battle?\\nOr are you unhappy?", "Você vai? Sério?\\nObrigada!\\n\\nEntÃo, uh...\\n\\nComo foram as coisas aqui\\nna TORRE BATALHA hoje?\\n\\nFicou satisfeito com a batalha?\\nOu você está infeliz?"},
}
